"Imerekebisha kuanguka kwa \"Faili nyingi mno zimefunguliwa\" kwa kutumia "
"tena rasilimali za arifa"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:715
msgid ""
"Fixed Ctrl+V paste for text content - now works for both text and images"
msgstr ""
"Imerekebisha ubandikaji wa Ctrl+V kwa maudhui ya maandishi - sasa unafanya "
"kazi kwa maandishi na picha"

#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:558
